:55 - LeBron Wants to Help Embiid Finally Win a Championship\n01:51:55 - Chris Finch Calls Out NBA\u2019s Flopping Problem\n01:55:45 - Bam Adebayo Has ZERO Regrets About Scoring 83\n02:08:05 - A\u2019Ja Wilson Drops 36 as Aces Eliminate Caitlin Clark & Fever\n02:13:00 - Q and Ayyyyy\n\n\nDownload PrizePicks app today and use code SHANNON to get $150 instantly in Lineups if you win your first $5 Lineup! https://prizepicks.onelink.me/LME0/NIGHTCAP\n\nShop new deals every day, only with Prime Big Deal Days October 6-7.\n\nFollow Nightcap on all platforms: \nTwitter: https://twitter.com/NightcapShow_\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/nightcapshow_/\nTikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@nightcapshow_\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61551822396133\n\nABOUT NIGHTCAP:\nNo more waiting until morning. Nightcap is the new nighttime sports talk destination with legends Shannon Sharpe, Chad \u201cOchocinco\u201d Johnson and \"Iso\" Joe Johnson. Hang out with Unc and Ocho as they give their unfiltered takes on the latest headlines from the NFL, NBA, and college football, and give their instant reactions to the biggest games moments after they end.\n\n#Nightcap #ShannonSharpe #ochocinco #joejohnson #unc #ocho #iso"}]},"displayStyle":"MUSIC_MULTI_ROW_LIST_ITEM_DISPLAY_STYLE_EXPANDED"}},{"musicMultiRowListItemRenderer":{"thumbnail":{"musicThumbnailRenderer":{"thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/X-Ez_cARboo/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEWCJADEOEBIAQqCggAEOADGC0guwJIWg&rs=AMzJL3m-VoJNY1T_rKs3hzaHuM_-ovgjgw","width":400,"height":225},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/X-Ez_cARboo/hq720.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEKCKAGEMIDIABIWg&rs=AMzJL3kr1I2Sc8E_41Fw-ocWzjlSb62L5g","width":800,"height":450},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/X-Ez_cARboo/hq720.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEKCNUGEN8DIABIWg&rs=AMzJL3kinz9PbUfacqb7Yye83F2bJ912Pg","width":853,"height":479}]},"thumbnailCrop":"MUSIC_THUMBNAIL_CROP_UNSPECIFIED","thumbnailScale":"MUSIC_THUMBNAIL_SCALE_ASPECT_FIT"}},"onTap":{"watchEndpoint":{"vi